              "text": "आदरातिथ्य — ādarātithya — \"hospitality\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "त्यांच्या आदरातिथ्याने आम्ही खूश झालो. tyāñcyā ādarātithyāne āmhī khūś jhālo. We were delighted by their hospitality."
            },
