          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विचारपूस करणे — vicārpūs karṇe — \"to ask after\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आजीने फोनवर सगळ्यांची विचारपूस केली. ājīne phonvar sagaḷyāñcī vicārpūs kelī. Grandmother asked after everyone on the phone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने विचारपूस केली, tyāne vicārpūs kelī."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person asked about takes -ची: माझी विचारपूस केली, asked after me."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विचारपूस करणे (vicārpūs karṇe) is built from विचार, \"a thought, a question\", and pūs, \"asking\", from the family of Sanskrit pṛcchati, \"asks\", where CDIAL lists Marathi pusṇẽ, \"to ask\" (CDIAL 8352); करणे makes it a verb."
            }
          ]
        },
