          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फिरकणे (phirakṇe) is a Marathi verb that looks built on phir-, \"to turn\" (CDIAL 9078); how it came to mean dropping in is not settled."
